WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Dad likes an old fashioned home grown tomato.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Cut one.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Any father that's over 50 years old will appreciate this tomato.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Put it right here with these other ones.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Come on, Dad. Try a tomato.
